{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "168", "x": 0.8949472934591233, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03879595514451251, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "castle walls in the northwest corner of the site. It actually dates to the time", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7718774154238336, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the castle and not the ancient village. We found oyster shells and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fishbones and we assumed they were thrown from the castle kitchen above.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.777641060751879, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "One area we excavated in the first summer uncovered the sight of a meeting", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7717398269358274, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hall. We knew it was an important building because it had two rows of post", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7714596262370789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "holes deep enough to support a large roof. It's the largest structure in a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7713262412721789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "central area of the site next to the current excavation area. Last year, we", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "discovered a fish pond in the ancient village. Normally, these were beside a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.7718147726770588, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "river. The pond here is further away, but it's possible the river has moved", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7713262412721789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "slightly. Anyway, to get there, from here, you turn right at the first", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7711518463257568, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "information board you come to and follow the path into the trees. Before you", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7721511570504924, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "come out of the trees, you'll see it on your right. If you reach the river, you've", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.7715656370393131, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "gone too far. So, does anyone have...", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.37300157078481727, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}